  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 0 .5em .5em; width: 25em; font-size: 90%;\" cellspacing=\"5\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#062A78\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: larger;\"><b>Union Party</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#062A78\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 1em 0; text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Union_Logo.png/revision/latest?cb=20151025172838\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Union Logo\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Union_Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20151025172838\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Union Logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Union_Logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Chairperson</b>\n</td>\n<td>Cora Fabian\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Headquarters</b>\n</td>\n<td>A-4 Founder St. W, Bradbury, BR, 719234\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Official&#160;ideology</b>\n</td>\n<td>Post-Scarcity <br /> Unionism\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Official color(s)</b>\n</td>\n<td>Dark Blue\n</td></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>Union Party</b> was one of the major contemporary political parties in the United States and its <a href=\"/wiki/Associated_state\" title=\"Associated state\">Associated states</a>.\n</p><p>Tracing its origins back to the founding of the <a href=\"/wiki/Interplanetary_Trade_Commission\" title=\"Interplanetary Trade Commission\">Interplanetary Trade Commission</a>, the Union Party was founded around 2088 in an effort to unite the colonial delegation to Earth under a single political apparatus. There have been 3 Unionist presidents, the first being <a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_Halvidar\" title=\"Lionel Halvidar\">Lionel Halvidar</a>, who served from 2133 to 2141.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119032822\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 119/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 910/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 255/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.559      1 Template:Infobox_political_party\n100.00%    4.559      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:912-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119032822 and revision id 5681. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
